          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea suh ea munyas aba heedeang'wa aba jeeda diyeanga badiina ng'eanyi badiina ng'eanyi aba badayda ng'eanyiida: udamoorooda, ea murjeang'eeda, ea hagiireeda aba heeluutkaaschi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ghajiloosiida, ea hagiireeda haw, ea gharbeasheeda, ea udagurgung', ea gheadeamooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh mii miyaasiin aba heedeang'wa aba jeeda diyeanga sean badiina ng'eanyi; siida wassean jea ghwasat dugusu iinimeewa gaygaba ririnnyaan ea ghwahita shing'ada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gida wasean jea goobissa badayda haleanjeeni nimeewean gaygaba ririnnyaan, ea gidasisina geeta gil ghana ea hang'da ghana ea muunda ghana ea muunda ghana ea mushoota, dabicheanda wassean sisina gadiyeeda wassean; gajeayiin jeeda beega, ak gaygaba ririnnyaan ea ghwahita shing'ada; ak gayghamiidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gida wasean iyabisa jeeda dabicheanda wassean bea sigeeda, haleanjeeda sean mida jeeda gaygaba ririnnyaan, gajeenyarja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamita wassean mida jeeda jea eayaak, guuyi sea beega, gajea muy; nea haleanjeeda sean sileeha leabu jeedeaba dabicheandida gaygaba ririnnyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gida wasean abissa heeda wassean aba muscheeka gaygaba ririnnyaan; ada ea gidasiiwooliida gil ghanea dahuuda gajeenyarja; aba gideaba gaba ririnnyaan, ak gaygaba ririnnyaan aba heedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara gheang'deenda ghana dabascheanda ang'oonyi beega gagasa aamiy; nea gida wasean jea gaweapji sea muscheeka nyaawa gaygaba ririnnyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama deepa goobissa heeda wassean bea muscheeka nyaawa badayda histeanga jea eehista, gajea miyaas; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama siyiin beega jeeda histeanga ak goobissa heeda wassean aba muscheeka nyaawa, gajea muy aba heedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
