          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Giliwas diyeayda badiina ng'eanyi aba badayda ng'eanyiida eamuy; majeayaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gida wasean badiina jeeda, ea gida wasean badiina geeshan ang'wan, ghana ea gidamideawa geeshanga saang'a, ea diyeanga sean badiina ng'eanyi badiina ng'eanyi aba badayda ng'eanyiida, majayaaga; aba gideaba eamuy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoabwari geat ririnnyeanda aba gida wasean badiina ng'eanyi; adoabwari geat ririnnyeanda aba haleanjeeni, aba gideaba gajanyasa ririnnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; asi oamiini geat, ak goowooschi ghaydidi, aba gideaba aniini geawooschi ghaydit. Adoabwari geat ririnnyeanda aba gida wasean badiina ng'eanyi angiira geaw ng'eanyi aba badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA eananeey ng'eanyiida Misri, ak ghaahuuyi ASEATAANG'U; asi gaywoosa ghaydit, aba gideaba aniini geawooschi ghaydit.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.11.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
